## Model weights & licensing

Model weights have their own terms and are **not** covered by the AGPL license
of the code (see `registry/models.yaml` for each model's source/preprocess
contract):

- **DINOv3 ViT-S/16** (near-duplicate detection tower, `dinov3-vits16-onnx`) —
  weights are gated by **Meta's DINOv3 license** and are **NOT bundled** with
  installers and NOT downloadable by the app. To enable visual near-duplicate
  detection, obtain the weights from Meta yourself and place the ONNX export
  (`model.onnx` + `model.onnx_data`) into
  `{models root}/models/dinov3-vits16-onnx/`. When absent, the app reports
  「判重不可用，需自备模型（Meta 许可）」 via `GET /api/library/stats`
  (`dedupAvailable=false`) and the Settings → Diagnostics section; it never
  panics and never presents the pHash layer as dedup-tower results.
- **SigLIP 2 base patch16-224** (semantic embedding tower,
  `siglip2-base-p224-onnx`) — bundled; ONNX export of
  `onnx-community/siglip2-base-patch16-224` (Apache-2.0；
  **许可待复核** — 交付前以 Hugging Face 模型卡当前 license 字段为准).
- **U²-Net** (subject segmentation, `u2net`) — bundled; rembg-distributed
  ONNX (Apache-2.0).
- **RealESRGAN-general-x4v3** (super-resolution, `realesr-general-x4v3`) —
  bundled; BSD-3-Clause (Real-ESRGAN official weights, ONNX re-export).
- **PP-OCRv6-medium det/rec** (OCR) — not bundled; fetched on demand with
  sha256 pinning; Apache-2.0 (PaddlePaddle official ONNX).
- **Big-LaMa** (inpainting, `lama-fp32`) — not bundled; fetched on demand with
  sha256 pinning; Apache-2.0 (Carve/LaMa-ONNX export).

Fonts and other assets shipped in packs carry their own permissive
Apache/BSD/OFL licensing as noted in each pack's metadata.
